      "heading": "Battle quotes",
      "level": 3,
      "paragraphs": [
        "As Prophet Varesh Abaddon will not allow me to be defeated! It will be my pleasure to dedicate your bones to this day. You cannot stop this! You can only die to celebrate Abaddon! Soon all of Elona will bow before my new army. I do not fear you, I know what must be done. It has begun.",
        "As Commander Varesh The gate to Abaddon's prison is nearly opened! Welcome to your end. You will not live to see the sun rise. If it ever rises again. Your arrogance has doomed you! Taste the wrath of Abaddon's army!"
