  "html": "<div class=\"mw-parser-output\"><div id=\"Spoiler&#95;tag\" style=\"background: #F99; padding: 2px; margin: 3px 0px; border: 1px solid #F00; text-align: center\">\n<b><a href=\"/wiki/Template:Spoiler\" title=\"Template:Spoiler\">Spoiler alert</a>:</b> The following text contains spoilers relating to the story of <i><a href=\"/wiki/Guild_Wars_Nightfall\" title=\"Guild Wars Nightfall\">Guild Wars Nightfall</a></i>.</div>\n<p><br />\n</p>\n<table style=\"margin: 0 0 0.5em 1em; border:1px solid silver; float:right; text-align:left; font-size:90%; background-color:white;\" cellpadding=\"5\" class=\"infobox npc-infobox\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<th colspan=\"2\" style=\"font-size:110%; text-align:center; background-color:#EBB;\">Varesh Ossa\n</th></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"2\" align=\"center\" class=\"infobox-image\"><a href=\"/wiki/File:Varesh_Ossa.jpg\" class=\"image\"><img alt=\"Varesh Ossa.jpg\" src=\"/images/thumb/e/e0/Varesh_Ossa.jpg/150px-Varesh_Ossa.jpg\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"150\" height=\"225\" srcset=\"/images/thumb/e/e0/Varesh_Ossa.jpg/225px-Varesh_Ossa.jpg 1.5x, /images/thumb/e/e0/Varesh_Ossa.jpg/300px-Varesh_Ossa.jpg 2x\" data-file-width=\"400\" data-file-height=\"600\" /></a>\n</td></tr>\n<tr valign=\"top\">\n<th style=\"background-color:#EBB;\"><a href=\"/wiki/Affiliation\" title=\"Affiliation\">Affiliations</a>\n</th>\n<td><a href=\"/wiki/Kournan_military\" title=\"Kournan military\">Kournan military</a><br />\n<p><a href=\"/wiki/Margonite\" title=\"Margonite\">Margonites</a>\n</p>\n</td></tr>\n<tr valign=\"top\">\n<th style=\"background-color:#EBB;\"><a href=\"/wiki/Creature_type\" title=\"Creature type\">Types</a>\n</th>\n<td><a href=\"/wiki/Human\" title=\"Human\">Human</a><br /><a href=\"/wiki/Demon\" title=\"Demon\">Demon</a>\n</td></tr>\n<tr valign=\"top\">\n<th style=\"background-color:#EBB;\"><a href=\"/wiki/Profession\" title=\"Profession\">Professions</a>\n</th>\n<td><a href=\"/wiki/File:Dervish-tango-icon-20.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"Dervish\"><img alt=\"Dervish\" src=\"/images/3/3e/Dervish-tango-icon-20.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" data-file-width=\"20\" data-file-height=\"20\" /></a> <a href=\"/wiki/Dervish\" title=\"Dervish\">Dervish</a><br /><a href=\"/wiki/File:Paragon-tango-icon-20.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"Paragon\"><img alt=\"Paragon\" src=\"/images/5/55/Paragon-tango-icon-20.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" data-file-width=\"20\" data-file-height=\"20\" /></a> <a href=\"/wiki/Paragon\" title=\"Paragon\">Paragon</a>\n</td></tr>\n\n\n<tr valign=\"top\">\n<th style=\"background-color:#EBB;\"><a href=\"/wiki/Level\" title=\"Level\">Level(s)</a>\n</th>\n<td>20, 29 (32), 30 (32)\n</td></tr>\n<tr valign=\"top\">\n<th style=\"background-color:#EBB;\"><a href=\"/wiki/Campaign\" title=\"Campaign\">Campaign</a>\n</th>\n<td><a href=\"/wiki/Nightfall\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Nightfall\">Nightfall</a>\n</td></tr>\n\n<tr>\n<th colspan=\"2\" style=\"text-align:center; background-color:#EBB;\">Image(s)\n</th></tr>\n<tr style=\"text-align:center;\">\n<td colspan=\"2\" align=\"center\"><a href=\"/wiki/File:Prophet_Varesh.jpg\" class=\"image\"><img alt=\"Prophet Varesh.jpg\" src=\"/images/thumb/e/ef/Prophet_Varesh.jpg/150px-Prophet_Varesh.jpg\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"150\" height=\"240\" srcset=\"/images/thumb/e/ef/Prophet_Varesh.jpg/225px-Prophet_Varesh.jpg 1.5x, /images/thumb/e/ef/Prophet_Varesh.jpg/300px-Prophet_Varesh.jpg 2x\" data-file-width=\"408\" data-file-height=\"653\" /></a><br /><small>Prophet Varesh</small>\n</td></tr>\n<tr style=\"text-align:center;\">\n<td colspan=\"2\" align=\"center\"><a href=\"/wiki/File:Commander_Varesh.jpg\" class=\"image\"><img alt=\"Commander Varesh.jpg\" src=\"/images/thumb/f/f9/Commander_Varesh.jpg/150px-Commander_Varesh.jpg\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"150\" height=\"223\" srcset=\"/images/thumb/f/f9/Commander_Varesh.jpg/225px-Commander_Varesh.jpg 1.5x, /images/thumb/f/f9/Commander_Varesh.jpg/300px-Commander_Varesh.jpg 2x\" data-file-width=\"386\" data-file-height=\"573\" /></a><br /><small>Commander Varesh</small>\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<blockquote style=\"font-style: italic; padding: 0em 2em 0em 1em; margin: 1em 0em 1em 4em; border-left: 1px solid #DDD;\"><div style=\"position: absolute; margin-top: -0.2em; margin-left: -0.8em; font: bold 5em Times New Roman, Times, Georgie, serif; color: #EEE;\">“</div>\n<p>Centuries ago, <a href=\"/wiki/Turai_Ossa\" title=\"Turai Ossa\">Turai Ossa</a> saved the nation of <a href=\"/wiki/Elona\" title=\"Elona\">Elona</a> by defeating the undead lord <a href=\"/wiki/Palawa_Joko\" title=\"Palawa Joko\">Palawa Joko</a>. In gratitude, the populace praised him as the warmarshal of <a href=\"/wiki/Kourna\" title=\"Kourna\">Kourna</a>... and the nation accepted him as their king. Since that time, all of Kourna’s warmarshals have been direct descendants of Turai. Varesh Ossa is the latest inheritor of that legacy—and like her ancestor, she has a vision for the future of the nation.\n</p><p>Varesh Ossa is a brilliant commander, a loyal Kournan who instills loyalty and dedication in her troops. Like her ancestor Turai, she has also shown an interest in more spiritual concerns. Elonians see much of Turai’s greatness in Varesh. By using political acumen, her charismatic presence, and the influence of her family legacy, Varesh has rallied the <a href=\"/wiki/Kournan_military\" title=\"Kournan military\">Kournan army</a>, inspiring them as Turai Ossa did long ago. Some loyal Elonians hope that she can unify the nation again, restoring it to the greatness of its past. Others fervently hope that she does not share his madness. History will see how well Varesh succeeds on her own spiritual quest.\n</p>\n<p style=\"text-align: right; font-size: 0.9em;\">— <a href=\"/wiki/Gameplay_manual\" title=\"Gameplay manual\">The Guild Wars Nightfall Manuscripts</a></p>\n</blockquote>\n<p><a class=\"mw-selflink selflink\">Warmarshal Varesh Ossa</a> was the current leader of Kourna and its military. She was trained by Generals <a href=\"/wiki/General_Morgahn\" title=\"General Morgahn\">Morgahn</a> and <a href=\"/wiki/General_Kahyet\" title=\"General Kahyet\">Kahyet</a> in military and religious aspects, respectively. In 1075 <small><a href=\"/wiki/Mouvelian_calendar\" title=\"Mouvelian calendar\">AE</a></small>, she, Morgahn, and Kahyet traveled to <a href=\"/wiki/Istan\" title=\"Istan\">Istan</a> as delegates. During their time there, Varesh and Kahyet send Kournans to <a href=\"/wiki/Fahranur,_the_First_City\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Fahranur, the First City\">Fahranur</a> to recover a scroll from the <a href=\"/wiki/Apocrypha\" title=\"Apocrypha\">Apocrypha</a> before its destruction at the hands of the <a href=\"/wiki/Order_of_the_Sunspears\" title=\"Order of the Sunspears\">Order of the Sunspears</a>. Soon it is revealed that Kahyet and Varesh were working with <a href=\"/wiki/Demon\" title=\"Demon\">demons</a> to bring about <a href=\"/wiki/Nightfall_(prophecy)\" title=\"Nightfall (prophecy)\">an ancient prophecy</a> and release the fallen <a href=\"/wiki/Gods_of_Tyria\" title=\"Gods of Tyria\">god</a> <a href=\"/wiki/Abaddon\" title=\"Abaddon\">Abaddon</a> from <a href=\"/wiki/Realm_of_Torment\" title=\"Realm of Torment\">his prison</a>, which she goes about by performing rituals in <a href=\"/wiki/Gandara,_the_Moon_Fortress\" title=\"Gandara, the Moon Fortress\">Gandara, the Moon Fortress</a>, the <a href=\"/wiki/Sebelkeh_Basilica\" title=\"Sebelkeh Basilica\">Sebelkeh Basilica</a>, and the <a href=\"/wiki/Mouth_of_Torment\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Mouth of Torment\">Mouth of Torment</a>. As she goes about this, she is slowly changed by Abaddon's power and eventually becomes a <a href=\"/wiki/Margonite\" title=\"Margonite\">Margonite</a>. She is <a href=\"/wiki/Antagonist\" title=\"Antagonist\">antagonized</a> by the Order of the Sunspears throughout, and finally killed before finishing her last ritual in the Mouth of Torment. However, she managed to weaken the barrier of <a href=\"/wiki/The_Mists\" title=\"The Mists\">The Mists</a> enough to open a giant <a href=\"/wiki/Vortex\" title=\"Vortex\">Vortex</a> which allows the Realm of Torment to start seeping into the <a href=\"/wiki/Tyria_(world)\" title=\"Tyria (world)\">human world</a>.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Locations\">Locations</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/index.php?title=Varesh_Ossa&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Locations\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/Istan\" title=\"Istan\">Istan</a>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/Consulate\" title=\"Consulate\">Consulate</a> (only during the <a href=\"/wiki/Jokanur_Diggings\" title=\"Jokanur Diggings\">Jokanur Diggings</a> <a href=\"/wiki/Mission\" title=\"Mission\">mission</a> ending cutscene)</li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Zehlon_Reach\" title=\"Zehlon Reach\">Zehlon Reach</a> near <a href=\"/wiki/The_Astralarium\" title=\"The Astralarium\">the Astralarium</a> (only during <a href=\"/wiki/The_Honorable_General\" title=\"The Honorable General\">The Honorable General</a>)</li></ul></li></ul>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/Kourna\" title=\"Kourna\">Kourna</a>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/Plaza_of_the_Five_Gods\" title=\"Plaza of the Five Gods\">Plaza of the Five Gods</a> in <a href=\"/wiki/Gandara,_the_Moon_Fortress\" title=\"Gandara, the Moon Fortress\">Gandara, the Moon Fortress</a> (during the <a href=\"/wiki/Consulate_Docks\" title=\"Consulate Docks\">Consulate Docks</a> mission)</li>\n<li>Fort in <a href=\"/wiki/Dejarin_Estate\" title=\"Dejarin Estate\">Dejarin Estate</a> (only during the <a href=\"/wiki/Kodonur_Crossroads\" title=\"Kodonur Crossroads\">Kodonur Crossroads</a> mission ending cutscene)</li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Fortress_of_Jahai\" title=\"Fortress of Jahai\">Fortress of Jahai</a> (only during the <a href=\"/wiki/Moddok_Crevice\" title=\"Moddok Crevice\">Moddok Crevice</a> mission ending cutscene)</li></ul></li></ul>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/Vabbi\" title=\"Vabbi\">Vabbi</a>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/Sebelkeh_Basilica\" title=\"Sebelkeh Basilica\">Sebelkeh Basilica</a> (during the cutscene before the <a href=\"/wiki/Grand_Court_of_Sebelkeh\" title=\"Grand Court of Sebelkeh\">Grand Court of Sebelkeh</a> mission)</li></ul></li>\n<li>Somewhere in <a href=\"/wiki/The_Desolation\" title=\"The Desolation\">The Desolation</a> (during the <a href=\"/wiki/Jennur%27s_Horde\" title=\"Jennur&#39;s Horde\">Jennur's Horde</a> and <a href=\"/wiki/Nundu_Bay\" title=\"Nundu Bay\">Nundu Bay</a> missions)</li></ul>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Missions\">Missions</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/index.php?title=Varesh_Ossa&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Missions\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/The_Desolation\" title=\"The Desolation\">The Desolation</a>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/Ruins_of_Morah\" title=\"Ruins of Morah\">Ruins of Morah</a> (as \"Prophet Varesh\" and \"Commander Varesh\")</li></ul></li></ul>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Skills\">Skills</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/index.php?title=Varesh_Ossa&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: Skills\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<dl><dt>As Prophet Varesh</dt></dl>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/Earth_Vortex\" title=\"Earth Vortex\"><img alt=\"Earth Vortex\" src=\"/images/thumb/b/ba/Earth_Vortex.jpg/25px-Earth_Vortex.jpg\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" srcset=\"/images/thumb/b/ba/Earth_Vortex.jpg/38px-Earth_Vortex.jpg 1.5x, /images/thumb/b/ba/Earth_Vortex.jpg/50px-Earth_Vortex.jpg 2x\" data-file-width=\"64\" data-file-height=\"64\" /></a> <a href=\"/wiki/Earth_Vortex\" title=\"Earth Vortex\">Earth Vortex</a> (<a href=\"/wiki/Monster_skill\" title=\"Monster skill\">monster skill</a>)</li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Enchantment_Collapse\" title=\"Enchantment Collapse\"><img alt=\"Enchantment Collapse\" src=\"/images/thumb/a/ac/Enchantment_Collapse.jpg/25px-Enchantment_Collapse.jpg\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" srcset=\"/images/thumb/a/ac/Enchantment_Collapse.jpg/38px-Enchantment_Collapse.jpg 1.5x, /images/thumb/a/ac/Enchantment_Collapse.jpg/50px-Enchantment_Collapse.jpg 2x\" data-file-width=\"64\" data-file-height=\"64\" /></a> <a href=\"/wiki/Enchantment_Collapse\" title=\"Enchantment Collapse\">Enchantment Collapse</a> (monster skill)</li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Frost_Vortex\" title=\"Frost Vortex\"><img alt=\"Frost Vortex\" src=\"/images/thumb/5/55/Frost_Vortex.jpg/25px-Frost_Vortex.jpg\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" srcset=\"/images/thumb/5/55/Frost_Vortex.jpg/38px-Frost_Vortex.jpg 1.5x, /images/thumb/5/55/Frost_Vortex.jpg/50px-Frost_Vortex.jpg 2x\" data-file-width=\"64\" data-file-height=\"64\" /></a> <a href=\"/wiki/Frost_Vortex\" title=\"Frost Vortex\">Frost Vortex</a> (monster skill)</li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Natural_Resistance\" title=\"Natural Resistance\"><img alt=\"Natural Resistance\" src=\"/images/thumb/0/02/Natural_Resistance.jpg/25px-Natural_Resistance.jpg\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" srcset=\"/images/thumb/0/02/Natural_Resistance.jpg/38px-Natural_Resistance.jpg 1.5x, /images/thumb/0/02/Natural_Resistance.jpg/50px-Natural_Resistance.jpg 2x\" data-file-width=\"64\" data-file-height=\"64\" /></a> <a href=\"/wiki/Natural_Resistance\" title=\"Natural Resistance\">Natural Resistance</a> (monster skill)</li></ul>\n<dl><dt>As Commander Varesh</dt></dl>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/Call_of_Sacrifice\" title=\"Call of Sacrifice\"><img alt=\"Call of Sacrifice\" src=\"/images/thumb/e/eb/Call_of_Sacrifice.jpg/25px-Call_of_Sacrifice.jpg\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" srcset=\"/images/thumb/e/eb/Call_of_Sacrifice.jpg/38px-Call_of_Sacrifice.jpg 1.5x, /images/thumb/e/eb/Call_of_Sacrifice.jpg/50px-Call_of_Sacrifice.jpg 2x\" data-file-width=\"64\" data-file-height=\"64\" /></a> <a href=\"/wiki/Call_of_Sacrifice\" title=\"Call of Sacrifice\">Call of Sacrifice</a> (monster skill)</li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Enemies_Must_Die!\" title=\"Enemies Must Die!\"><img alt=\"Enemies Must Die!\" src=\"/images/thumb/f/f5/Enemies_Must_Die%21.jpg/25px-Enemies_Must_Die%21.jpg\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" srcset=\"/images/thumb/f/f5/Enemies_Must_Die%21.jpg/38px-Enemies_Must_Die%21.jpg 1.5x, /images/thumb/f/f5/Enemies_Must_Die%21.jpg/50px-Enemies_Must_Die%21.jpg 2x\" data-file-width=\"64\" data-file-height=\"64\" /></a> <a href=\"/wiki/Enemies_Must_Die!\" title=\"Enemies Must Die!\">Enemies Must Die!</a> (monster skill)</li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Natural_Resistance\" title=\"Natural Resistance\"><img alt=\"Natural Resistance\" src=\"/images/thumb/0/02/Natural_Resistance.jpg/25px-Natural_Resistance.jpg\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" srcset=\"/images/thumb/0/02/Natural_Resistance.jpg/38px-Natural_Resistance.jpg 1.5x, /images/thumb/0/02/Natural_Resistance.jpg/50px-Natural_Resistance.jpg 2x\" data-file-width=\"64\" data-file-height=\"64\" /></a> <a href=\"/wiki/Natural_Resistance\" title=\"Natural Resistance\">Natural Resistance</a> (monster skill)</li></ul>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Dialogue\">Dialogue</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/index.php?title=Varesh_Ossa&amp;action=edit&amp;section=4\" title=\"Edit section: Dialogue\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<dl><dd><i>\"I am the <a href=\"/wiki/Warmarshal\" title=\"Warmarshal\">Warmarshal</a> of Kourna and I don't take kindly to being disturbed without reason. I don't have time for your foolish problems right now.\"</i></dd></dl>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Quotes\">Quotes</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/index.php?title=Varesh_Ossa&amp;action=edit&amp;section=5\" title=\"Edit section: Quotes\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Battle_quotes\">Battle quotes</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/index.php?title=Varesh_Ossa&amp;action=edit&amp;section=6\" title=\"Edit section: Battle quotes\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h3>\n<dl><dt>As Prophet Varesh</dt>\n<dd><i>Abaddon will not allow me to be defeated!</i></dd>\n<dd><i>It will be my pleasure to dedicate your bones to this day.</i></dd>\n<dd><i>You cannot stop this! You can only die to celebrate Abaddon!</i></dd>\n<dd><i>Soon all of Elona will bow before my new army.</i></dd>\n<dd><i>I do not fear you, I know what must be done.</i></dd>\n<dd><i>It has begun.</i></dd></dl>\n<dl><dt>As Commander Varesh</dt>\n<dd><i>The gate to Abaddon's prison is nearly opened!</i></dd>\n<dd><i>Welcome to your end.</i></dd>\n<dd><i>You will not live to see the sun rise. If it ever rises again.</i></dd>\n<dd><i>Your arrogance has doomed you!</i></dd>\n<dd><i>Taste the wrath of Abaddon's army!</i></dd></dl>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Armor_ratings\">Armor ratings</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/index.php?title=Varesh_Ossa&amp;action=edit&amp;section=7\" title=\"Edit section: Armor ratings\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"npc-statistics\" style=\"border: 1px solid #7777CC; font-size: 90%; text-align: center; float: left; margin-bottom: 0.5em;\">\n\n<tbody><tr>\n<th style=\"background: #EEEEFF; font-size: 120%; padding: 0 0.5em;\" colspan=\"8\"><a href=\"/wiki/Armor_rating\" title=\"Armor rating\"><span style=\"