ile-width=\"64\" data-file-height=\"64\" /></a>\n</td>\n<td>110\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<p><br style=\"clear: left; height: 0px;\" />\n</p><p><br />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Items_dropped\">Items dropped</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/index.php?title=Varesh_Ossa&amp;action=edit&amp;section=8\" title=\"Edit section: Items dropped\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/Margonite_Armor\" title=\"Margonite Armor\">Margonite Armor</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Margonite_Robes\" title=\"Margonite Robes\">Margonite Robes</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Margonite_Tunic\" title=\"Margonite Tunic\">Margonite Tunic</a></li></ul>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Gallery\">Gallery</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/index.php?title=Varesh_Ossa&amp;action=edit&amp;section=9\" title=\"Edit section: Gallery\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<ul class=\"gallery mw-gallery-traditional\">\n\t\t<li class=\"gallerybox\" style=\"width: 155px\"><div style=\"width: 155px\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"thumb\" style=\"width: 150px;\"><div style=\"margin:15px auto;\"><a href=\"/wiki/File:Varesh_Ossa_concept_art.jpg\" class=\"image\"><img alt=\"Varesh Ossa concept art.jpg\" src=\"/images/thumb/a/a1/Varesh_Ossa_concept_art.jpg/74px-Varesh_Ossa_concept_art.jpg\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"74\" height=\"120\" srcset=\"/images/thumb/a/a1/Varesh_Ossa_concept_art.jpg/112px-Varesh_Ossa_concept_art.jpg 1.5x, /images/thumb/a/a1/Varesh_Ossa_concept_art.jpg/149px-Varesh_Ossa_concept_art.jpg 2x\" data-file-width=\"280\" data-file-height=\"450\" /></a></div></div>\n\t\t\t<div class=\"gallerytext\">\n\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t</div></li>\n\t\t<li class=\"gallerybox\" style=\"width: 155px\"><div style=\"width: 155px\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"thumb\" style=\"width: 150px;\"><div style=\"margin:37.5px auto;\"><a href=\"/wiki/File:%22Varesh%22_wallpaper.jpg\" class=\"image\"><img alt=\"&quot;Varesh&quot; wallpaper.jpg\" src=\"/images/thumb/d/d7/%22Varesh%22_wallpaper.jpg/120px-%22Varesh%22_wallpaper.jpg\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"120\" height=\"75\" srcset=\"/images/thumb/d/d7/%22Varesh%22_wallpaper.jpg/180px-%22Varesh%22_wallpaper.jpg 1.5x, /images/thumb/d/d7/%22Varesh%22_wallpaper.jpg/240px-%22Varesh%22_wallpaper.jpg 2x\" data-file-width=\"1920\" data-file-height=\"1200\" /></a></div></div>\n\t\t\t<div class=\"gallerytext\">\n\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t</div></li>\n\t\t<li class=\"gallerybox\" style=\"width: 155px\"><div style=\"width: 155px\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"thumb\" style=\"width: 150px;\"><div style=\"margin:15px auto;\"><a href=\"/wiki/File:%22Varesh%22_concept_art_1.jpg\" class=\"image\"><img alt=\"&quot;Varesh&quot; concept art 1.jpg\" src=\"/images/thumb/1/12/%22Varesh%22_concept_art_1.jpg/92px-%22Varesh%22_concept_art_1.jpg\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"92\" height=\"120\" srcset=\"/images/thumb/1/12/%22Varesh%22_concept_art_1.jpg/139px-%22Varesh%22_concept_art_1.jpg 1.5x, /images/thumb/1/12/%22Varesh%22_concept_art_1.jpg/185px-%22Varesh%22_concept_art_1.jpg 2x\" data-file-width=\"1000\" data-file-height=\"1297\" /></a></div></div>\n\t\t\t<div class=\"gallerytext\">\n\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t</div></li>\n\t\t<li class=\"gallerybox\" style=\"width: 155px\"><div style=\"width: 155px\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"thumb\" style=\"width: 150px;\"><div style=\"margin:36px auto;\"><a href=\"/wiki/File:%22Varesh%22_concept_art_2.jpg\" class=\"image\"><img alt=\"&quot;Varesh&quot; concept art 2.jpg\" src=\"/images/thumb/d/d0/%22Varesh%22_concept_art_2.jpg/120px-%22Varesh%22_concept_art_2.jpg\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"120\" height=\"78\" srcset=\"/images/thumb/d/d0/%22Varesh%22_concept_art_2.jpg/180px-%22Varesh%22_concept_art_2.jpg 1.5x, /images/thumb/d/d0/%22Varesh%22_concept_art_2.jpg/240px-%22Varesh%22_concept_art_2.jpg 2x\" data-file-width=\"1023\" data-file-height=\"662\" /></a></div></div>\n\t\t\t<div class=\"gallerytext\">\n\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t</div></li>\n</ul>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Notes\">Notes</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/index.php?title=Varesh_Ossa&amp;action=edit&amp;section=10\" title=\"Edit section: Notes\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<ul><li>You can obtain a <a href=\"/wiki/Miniature_Varesh\" title=\"Miniature Varesh\">miniature of Varesh</a> in the collector's pack of <i>Nightfall</i>.</li>\n<li>As the game progresses, her hair recedes and shows the growth of eye-like ridges under her forehead's skin, similar to Margonite's extra eyes, and her eyes turn purple. Her first appearance in this form is in the <a href=\"/wiki/Pledge_of_the_Merchant_Princes_(cinematic)\" title=\"Pledge of the Merchant Princes (cinematic)\">Pledge of the Merchant Princes cinematic</a>.</li>\n<li>Although she still appears mostly <a href=\"/wiki/Human\" title=\"Human\">human</a> as Prophet Varesh, the game marks her as a Margonite.</li></ul>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Trivia\">Trivia</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/index.php?title=Varesh_Ossa&amp;action=edit&amp;section=11\" title=\"Edit section: Trivia\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<ul><li>The name Varesh is Sanskrit for \"superior deity\".</li>\n<li>The voice actor for this character is <a href=\"/wiki/Simbi_Khali_Williams\" title=\"Simbi Khali Williams\">Simbi Khali Williams</a>.</li></ul>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_also\">See also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/index.php?title=Varesh_Ossa&amp;action=edit&amp;section=12\" title=\"Edit section: See also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/Elonian_royalty_family_tree\